font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;is a form of sweet food made from flour, sugar, and other ingredients, that is usually&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baking\" title=\"Baking\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">baked</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bread\" title=\"Bread\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">bread</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate, and that share features with other desserts such as&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pastry\" title=\"Pastry\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">pastries</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meringue\" title=\"Meringue\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">meringues</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Custard\" title=\"Custard\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">custards</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">, and&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pie\" title=\"Pie\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">pies</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">.</span><br></p>\";s:13:\"icon_image_id\";i:299;s:15:\"banner_image_id\";i:300;s:8:\"position\";i:2;s:4:\"slug\";s:20:\"display-regular-cake\";s:9:\"parent_id\";N;s:6:\"status\";i:1;s:16:\"meta_description\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2025-05-22 09:05:44\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2025-05-22 09:05:44\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:13:{s:2:\"id\";i:10;s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Display Regular Cake\";s:11:\"description\";s:2127:\"<p><b style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Cake</b><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;is a form of sweet food made from flour, sugar, and other ingredients, that is usually&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baking\" title=\"Baking\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">baked</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bread\" title=\"Bread\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">bread</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate, and that share features with other desserts such as&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pastry\" title=\"Pastry\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">pastries</a><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">,&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meringue\" title=\"Meringue\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 0, 128); background: none rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">m